@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Google Authentication & First-Time Onboarding

autonumber
actor Student
participant "React Frontend\n(AuthContext)" as UI
participant "Google OAuth 2.0" as Google
participant "Supabase Auth\n(GoTrue)" as Auth
participant "PostgreSQL DB\n(profiles table)" as DB

Student -> UI: Click "Continue with IIITA Account"
UI -> Google: Redirect to OAuth consent (hd=iiita.ac.in)
Google -> Student: Prompt institutional login
Student -> Google: Enter IIITA email & password
Google --> UI: Return OAuth token & email claim

UI -> Auth: Exchange OAuth token for Supabase session
Auth --> UI: Return active session & user metadata

alt Email does NOT end in @iiita.ac.in (Domain Violation)
    UI -> Auth: Terminate session (signOut())
    UI -> Student: Display rejection error: "Only @iiita.ac.in accounts allowed"
else Valid @iiita.ac.in Domain
    UI -> DB: Query profiles where id = auth.uid()
    
    alt Profile Record Found (Returning Student)
        DB --> UI: Return existing Profile data
        UI -> Student: Route to /dashboard (Session active)
    else No Profile Found (First-Time User)
        DB --> UI: PGRST116 (0 rows returned)
        UI -> Student: Redirect to /onboarding form
        Student -> UI: Fill roll number, department, batch, phone
        UI -> DB: INSERT into profiles (id, email, full_name, roll_number, ...)
        DB --> UI: Profile created successfully
        UI -> Student: Redirect to /dashboard with welcome toast
    end
end

@enduml
